=== Build > rendered pages > a page with code blocks renders as expected ===
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Getting started · Fixture</title></head><body><nav><ul><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/guide/advanced/">Advanced</a></li><li><a href="/guide/getting-started/">Getting started</a></li></ul></nav><main><h1>Getting started</h1><div class="content"><h2 id="install">Install<a class="nacara-heading-anchor"
                       href="#install"
                       aria-label="Link to this section"
                       data-pagefind-ignore></a></h2>
<p>Back to the <a href="/">home page</a>, or straight to <a href="/guide/advanced/#going-further">the deep end</a>.</p>
<pre><code class="language-fsharp"><span class="tok-keyword">let</span> <span class="tok-variable">site</span> <span class="tok-keyword">=</span>
    Site.create <span class="tok-punctuation">"</span><span class="tok-string">Nacara</span><span class="tok-punctuation">"</span>
    <span class="tok-keyword">|&gt;</span> Site.baseUrl <span class="tok-punctuation">"</span><span class="tok-string">/</span><span class="tok-punctuation">"</span>
</code></pre><h2 id="inline-code">Inline code<a class="nacara-heading-anchor"
                       href="#inline-code"
                       aria-label="Link to this section"
                       data-pagefind-ignore></a></h2>
<p>Inside the backticks: <code>Site.create <span class="tok-punctuation">"</span><span class="tok-string">Nacara</span><span class="tok-punctuation">"</span></code>. Outside them:
<code>Site.baseUrl <span class="tok-punctuation">"</span><span class="tok-string">/</span><span class="tok-punctuation">"</span></code> and <code>Site.output <span class="tok-punctuation">"</span><span class="tok-string">out</span><span class="tok-punctuation">"</span></code>. Left as
written: <code>{:js}</code> and <code disabled="">plain</code>.</p>
<h2 id="next-steps">Next steps<a class="nacara-heading-anchor"
                       href="#next-steps"
                       aria-label="Link to this section"
                       data-pagefind-ignore></a></h2>
<p>Nothing else for now.</p>
</div></main><aside class="toc"><a href="#install">Install</a><a href="#inline-code">Inline code</a><a href="#next-steps">Next steps</a></aside></body></html>
