<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Advanced · Fixture</title></head><body><nav><ul><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/guide/advanced/">Advanced</a></li><li><a href="/guide/getting-started/">Getting started</a></li></ul></nav><main><h1>Advanced</h1><div class="content"><h2 id="going-further">Going further<a class="nacara-heading-anchor"
