                       data-pagefind-ignore></a></h2>
<p>A terminal block:</p>
<pre><code class="language-bash">dotnet run -- build
dotnet run -- watch
</code></pre>
<p>And a collapsed one:</p>
<pre><code class="language-json"><span class="tok-punctuation">{</span>
  <span class="tok-punctuation">"</span><span class="tok-type">a</span><span class="tok-punctuation">"</span><span class="tok-punctuation">:</span> <span class="tok-number">1</span><span class="tok-punctuation">,</span>
  <span class="tok-punctuation">"</span><span class="tok-type">b</span><span class="tok-punctuation">"</span><span class="tok-punctuation">:</span> <span class="tok-number">2</span><span class="tok-punctuation">,</span>
  <span class="tok-punctuation">"</span><span class="tok-type">c</span><span class="tok-punctuation">"</span><span class="tok-punctuation">:</span> <span class="tok-number">3</span>
<span class="tok-punctuation">}</span>
</code></pre></div></main><aside class="toc"><a href="#going-further">Going further</a></aside></body></html>
